{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:hsvg:2.0:schema:capability:effects",
  "title": "HyperSVG 2.0 capability effects: Effects",
  "description": "particle effects under addons.effects.particles of a block, by id (D31); the kinds spring, aim, follow, limit and dynamics are a 2.1 draft (spec/2.0/drafts/effect-kinds-2.1.json) | every entry names reducedMotion (rest shows the rest pose, finish the final pose); start is entry (default) or play; the call effects.play with {effect} starts one, effects.stop with {effect} stops it; durationMs (1..600000) ends a play run; effects:ended:<effect> fires when the run ends or rests, with {interrupted} | a numeric parameter is a number or a formula proven inside the stated range, read when the effect starts | at most 16 effects per block; unknown kinds and keys are refused | particles: seeded copies of the part 'source' (self-contained, kept in defs, translate-x, translate-y and opacity(0 1) ranges, a rotate range and pivot when spin is not [0, 0]) are made inside the empty group target; copy i is born at delayMs + i * emitMs / (count - 1) (at delayMs when count is 1; emitMs 0 is a burst), starts at position (default [0, 0] in the group), flies at a seeded speed and angle (degrees; defaults [80, 180] and [-150, -30]), falls with gravity (default 300, y down), turns at a seeded spin in degrees per second (default [0, 0]), fades out linearly and is removed after lifeMs (default 600); at most 64 copies per effect and 256 live copies per block; draws come from the unsigned LCG32 seed = (1664525 * seed + 1013904223) mod 2^32, random = seed / 2^32, in the order speed, angle, spin | particles: count defaults to 12; a copy's position stays inside the source's translate ranges | particles under reduced motion draw no copies for rest and finish alike; effects:ended:<effect> still fires at its normal time",
  "$comment": "Generated by docs/spec-2.0-work/tools/schema/make-schemas.mjs from the spec/2.0 machine files. Do not edit.",
